diff --git a/.changeset/product-storage-conditions.md b/.changeset/product-storage-conditions.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..b7417c6
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.changeset/product-storage-conditions.md
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+---
+"saleor-dashboard": patch
+---
+
+Staff can now set "Storage conditions" (for example "Keep refrigerated at 2–8 °C") on a product in General Information, and translate it on the product translation page. Customers see it on the storefront below the product description.
diff --git a/CONTEXT.md b/CONTEXT.md
index 52e02db..d5be7b7 100644
--- a/CONTEXT.md
+++ b/CONTEXT.md
@@ -47,3 +47,12 @@ _Avoid_: pin location, pin destination, pin group.
 A sidebar section that exists only when it holds at least one navigation pin, and only ever
 holds user pins. Organization pins cannot target it.
 _Avoid_: favourites, my pins, quick links.
+
+## Product content
+
+**Storage conditions**:
+Short plain-text handling guidance for a product, such as "Keep refrigerated at 2–8 °C".
+Optional, shared by all variants of the product, and translatable per language. Shown to
+customers as its own labelled block after the product description.
+_API name_: `storageConditions`. _Avoid_: storage, storage instructions, handling notes.
+Not part of the product description, and unrelated to warehouse stock.
